nodes.body:
@matthewkotila @NickLucche, this is a follow-up to #48915. It populates metrics.speculative_decoding on `/v1/responses`, which has been null until now, including for gpt-oss.

Multi-turn responses (built-in tools) report acceptance summed across turns. Acceptance counts are additive, unlike timing, which stays omitted. On live gpt-oss tool-calling requests, the reported counts exactly match the engine's Prometheus counter deltas in both streaming and non-streaming.

It pairs with ai-dynamo/aiperf#1465 on the consume side. Would appreciate a review when you have a moment.

